                     Parameters for BICALIB
                     **********************

START OF PARAMETERS:
grid.dat                          \file with secondary data
2                                 \   column for secondary variable
bivariate.dat                     \file with calibration scatterplot
3  4  0                           \   columns of pri, sec, and weight
-1.0e21   1.0e21                  \   trimming limits
bicalib_run.out                   \file for output data / distributions
bicalib_run.cal                   \file for output calibration (SISIM)
bicalib_run.rep                   \file for calibration report
5                                 \number of thresholds on primary
1.0 3.0 5.0 7.0 10.0             \   thresholds on primary
5                                 \number of thresholds on secondary
1.0 3.0 5.0 7.0 10.0             \   thresholds on secondary
